sequenceDiagram
    participant CLIENT as Client/API Gateway
    participant ORDER as Order Service
    participant INVENTORY as Inventory Service
    participant PAYMENT as Payment Service
    participant LOGISTICS as Logistics Service
    participant NOTIFICATION as Notification Service
    participant ANALYTICS as Analytics Service
    participant KAFKA as Kafka Event Bus

    Note over CLIENT,ANALYTICS: Order Fulfillment Saga - Happy Path

    CLIENT->>ORDER: POST /orders (create order)
    activate ORDER
    ORDER->>ORDER: Validate order data
    ORDER->>ORDER: Create order (PENDING)
    ORDER->>KAFKA: Publish OrderCreated event
    ORDER-->>CLIENT: 201 Created (orderId)
    deactivate ORDER

    KAFKA->>INVENTORY: OrderCreated event
    activate INVENTORY
    INVENTORY->>INVENTORY: Check stock availability
    alt Stock Available
        INVENTORY->>INVENTORY: Reserve stock
        INVENTORY->>KAFKA: Publish StockReserved event
        INVENTORY-->>KAFKA: Success
    else Insufficient Stock
        INVENTORY->>KAFKA: Publish StockReservationFailed event
        INVENTORY-->>KAFKA: Failure
    end
    deactivate INVENTORY

    KAFKA->>ORDER: StockReserved event
    activate ORDER
    ORDER->>ORDER: Update order status (STOCK_RESERVED)
    ORDER->>KAFKA: Publish OrderStockReserved event
    deactivate ORDER

    KAFKA->>PAYMENT: OrderStockReserved event
    activate PAYMENT
    PAYMENT->>PAYMENT: Initiate payment processing
    PAYMENT->>PAYMENT: Fraud check
    alt Payment Successful
        PAYMENT->>PAYMENT: Process payment (PaymentGateway/M-Pesa)
        PAYMENT->>KAFKA: Publish PaymentCompleted event
    else Payment Failed
        PAYMENT->>KAFKA: Publish PaymentFailed event
    end
    deactivate PAYMENT

    KAFKA->>ORDER: PaymentCompleted event
    activate ORDER
    ORDER->>ORDER: Update order status (CONFIRMED)
    ORDER->>KAFKA: Publish OrderConfirmed event
    deactivate ORDER

    KAFKA->>LOGISTICS: OrderConfirmed event
    activate LOGISTICS
    LOGISTICS->>LOGISTICS: Create shipment
    LOGISTICS->>LOGISTICS: Assign courier
    LOGISTICS->>KAFKA: Publish ShipmentCreated event
    deactivate LOGISTICS

    KAFKA->>NOTIFICATION: OrderConfirmed event
    activate NOTIFICATION
    NOTIFICATION->>NOTIFICATION: Send order confirmation email
    NOTIFICATION->>NOTIFICATION: Send SMS to customer
    NOTIFICATION->>KAFKA: Publish EmailSent event
    deactivate NOTIFICATION

    KAFKA->>ANALYTICS: OrderCreated, PaymentCompleted, OrderConfirmed
    activate ANALYTICS
    ANALYTICS->>ANALYTICS: Process analytics events
    ANALYTICS->>ANALYTICS: Update dashboards
    deactivate ANALYTICS

    Note over CLIENT,ANALYTICS: Compensation Flow - Payment Failure

    KAFKA->>ORDER: PaymentFailed event
    activate ORDER
    ORDER->>ORDER: Trigger compensation saga
    ORDER->>KAFKA: Publish OrderCancelled event
    deactivate ORDER

    KAFKA->>INVENTORY: OrderCancelled event
    activate INVENTORY
    INVENTORY->>INVENTORY: Release reserved stock
    INVENTORY->>KAFKA: Publish StockReleased event
    deactivate INVENTORY

    KAFKA->>NOTIFICATION: OrderCancelled event
    activate NOTIFICATION
    NOTIFICATION->>NOTIFICATION: Send cancellation email
    NOTIFICATION->>KAFKA: Publish EmailSent event
    deactivate NOTIFICATION
